+;*****************************************************************************
+;* x86inc.asm: x264asm abstraction layer
+;*****************************************************************************
+;* Copyright (C) 2005-2016 x264 project
+;*
+;* Authors: Loren Merritt <lorenm@u.washington.edu>
+;*          Anton Mitrofanov <BugMaster@narod.ru>
